      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines. they dont get it. they just tell you 'it gets better' but it won't. my life is basically a crater now. everyone's gonna see me at the very bottom, begging for scraps, losing everything i worked for. the shame is actually worse than the money part. i just feel like i'm waiting for the impact.",
