    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"let the weight drop\"? it feels like no matter what i do, the only way to stop being a joke to everyone is to just disappear. i dont want to be the guy who lost it all and then spent years crawling back through the dirt. there has to be some way to just control when the story ends instead of letting it just drag me through the mud.",
